-I'd like to get the wizard down--any advice you can offer is
-appreciated. Thanks for your time.

See above. There are penalties. But the worst penalty is dying and losing the
game. So armor up, talk to the priest, level up your pet(s), and try to keep
your experience down until you've exhausted your guaranteed drop in AC
(naked AC2 to naked AC1). Also note that metal shoes have less of an effect 
than metal hats (spells in the head and all that).

But getting your AC down is the key to surviving the early game. Mid and late
game it's possible that you may be able to get away with just studded leather
if you have the rest of the armor together (shirt, CoMR/Robe,HoB,RoP,naked 1AC)
which enchanted up can get you well into the -30's.

